TITLE Mix river water and seawater; report molality of HCl
SOLUTION 1 River
    units mg/L
    pH 6.0 charge
    Cl 10

SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    units mg/L
    pH 8.1 charge
    Cl 19000

MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_hcl.sel
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings HCl_m
10 PUNCH MOL("HCl")
END
